  <NAME>Homo sapiens</NAME>
  <TITLE>Gene Expression data from 56 lung cancer cell lines</TITLE>
  <DESCRIPTION>Highlighting the gene expression characteristics of a large panel of lung cancer cell lines. Microarrays were used to explore and detail the global gene expression profile of 56 lung cancer cell lines Overall design: Gene expression was measured and recorded on HG-U133A chips in a large panel of lung cancer cell lines under ATCC recommended growth conditions</DESCRIPTION>
